&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;	&lt;span style="color:#8a93a5;font-style:italic"&gt;// BEncoding represents Base64 encoding scheme as defined by RFC 2045.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;	&lt;span style="color:#aa89ea"&gt;BEncoding&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#abb2bf"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#00b1f7"&gt;WordEncoder&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#abb2bf"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#98c379"&gt;&amp;#39;b&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#abb2bf"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;	&lt;span style="color:#8a93a5;font-style:italic"&gt;// QEncoding represents the Q-encoding scheme as defined by RFC 2047.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;	&lt;span style="color:#aa89ea"&gt;QEncoding&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#abb2bf"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#00b1f7"&gt;WordEncoder&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#abb2bf"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#98c379"&gt;&amp;#39;q&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#abb2bf"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#abb2bf"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="变量"&gt;变量&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://cs.opensource.google/go/go/+/go1.20.1:src/mime/mediatype.go;l=127"&gt;View Source&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>multipart</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/mime/multipart/</link><pubDate>Wed, 17 May 2023 11:11:20 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/mime/multipart/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;原文：&lt;a href="https://pkg.go.dev/mime/multipart@go1.24.2"&gt;https://pkg.go.dev/mime/multipart@go1.24.2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Package multipart implements MIME multipart parsing, as defined in &lt;a href="https://rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2046.html"&gt;RFC 2046&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​	Package multipart 实现 MIME multipart 解析，如 RFC 2046 中所定义。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The implementation is sufficient for HTTP (&lt;a href="https://rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2388.html"&gt;RFC 2388&lt;/a&gt;) and the multipart bodies generated by popular browsers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​	该实现足以用于 HTTP (RFC 2388) 和流行浏览器生成的 multipart 主体。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Copyright 2023 The Go Authors. All rights reserved. Use of this source code is governed by a BSD-style license that can be found in the LICENSE file.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>quotedprintable</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/mime/quotedprintable/</link><pubDate>Wed, 17 May 2023 11:11:20 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/mime/quotedprintable/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;原文：&lt;a href="https://pkg.go.dev/mime/quotedprintable@go1.24.2"&gt;https://pkg.go.dev/mime/quotedprintable@go1.24.2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Package quotedprintable implements quoted-printable encoding as specified by &lt;a href="https://rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2045.html"&gt;RFC 2045&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​	Package quotedprintable 实现 RFC 2045 中指定的 quoted-printable 编码。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="常量"&gt;常量&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This section is empty.&lt;/p&gt;
